  "title": "Ellen C Probable NDE 4880",
  "date": "1946",
  "content": "I was in the same hospital for a second time with pneumonia. I recall being in old fashioned oxygen tent with heavy plastic tucked in around bed. There was a zipper for staff to work with noisy machine and me. My parents were away on vacation and had been called back because 'she may not make it'. Grandmother had been caring for me. At time of the experience, I no longer had the sensation of not being able to breathe. I felt no pain and had a sensation of floating. Everything was very bright. There was a feeling of softness on clouds. The clouds parted and revealed large, white gates opening at the end of the experience.",
